tests/golden/check/out-cell-cannot-end.hero:14:21: error[cell_cannot_end]: `consumes` on `@p` of `h_eat` says the call takes a `H` in and ends its life, and `@` says the opposite: `p` is a cell `h_eat` writes into, where a `H` comes out to the program, and a cell that receives a handle cannot end one
tests/golden/check/out-cell-cannot-end.hero:15:22: error[cell_cannot_end]: `transfers` on `@p` of `h_give` says the call takes a `H` in and hands its life into another value, and `@` says the opposite: `p` is a cell `h_give` writes into, where a `H` comes out to the program, and a cell that receives a handle cannot end one
